  <p id="c-jinshu-066-taoqi-banner:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-066-taoqi-banner:p001:m0000" ref="0wt_4fd_ozd">旗</persName>，歷位散騎常侍、郴縣開國伯。咸和末，為散騎侍郎。性甚凶暴。卒，子<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taoqi-banner:p001:m0033" ref="qa4_e9t_zuj">定</persName>嗣。卒，子<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taoqi-banner:p001:m0039" ref="c7g_pbv_o6c">襲之</persName>嗣。卒，子<persName id="c-jinshu-066-taoqi-banner:p001:m0046" ref="tdr_p0j_xho">謙之</persName>嗣。宋受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
